          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"the-terralith\">The terralith</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">One config, one estate, three teams' worth of IAM and log groups. The account stands it up, and every taggable resource comes back carrying two tags: which estate owns it, and which address it answers to. Nobody wrote a tag by hand.</span></span><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 1rem'><marimo-ui-element object-id='PKri-1' random-id='f50b654c-686b-8a07-29e8-fd5293991b5e'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003erun setup&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><code>setup</code> \u00b7 not started</span></span></div></div>"
