            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"the-villain\">The villain</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">A plan of the whole monolith. It re-reads everything the estate owns, every time, and the request count is the number the split is meant to bring down.</span></span><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 1rem'><marimo-ui-element object-id='PKri-2' random-id='8928b514-c30f-08de-8223-ca00df4a19f6'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003erun slow-plan&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><code>slow-plan</code> \u00b7 not started</span></span></div></div>"
