        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"the-split-by-retag\">The split, by retag</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Three team configs, three estates. Each apply rewrites tofu-estate on the resources it declares. Nothing is re-created and no state file is split: where there was one boundary there are now three, and each cost a tag write.</span></span><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 1rem'><marimo-ui-element object-id='PKri-3' random-id='e368f452-6910-30aa-992d-910b879465ed'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003erun decompose&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><code>decompose</code> \u00b7 not started</span></span></div></div>"
